  "description": "What would you sacrifice for love? \n\nA captive princess doomed to become a living sacrifice, and a savage, murderous prince intent on overtaking his three older brothers and seizing the throne. Caught up in a deadly dance with destiny in a brutal, drought-stricken desert, can they overcome their grim fates… and perhaps, find love? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
